{
  "_comment": [
    "The conversation catalog (see DATAPACK.md). This is not a second dialogue engine - MCA's JSON stays",
    "authoritative for what happens. The catalog is the machine-readable claim that a topic exists, where",
    "it is entered, how deep it may be, and which durable state it may write, so that 'every shipped topic",
    "is a real conversation' is something lint can check and so arc, milestone and exclusive ids are",
    "declared in exactly one place. Adding a topic to a category without adding it here fails lint.",
    "All 28 topics listed here are converted: every one opens a branching exchange, and none pays",
    "hearts for being clicked."
